oat":{"reason":"analysisUnavailable"},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T06:14:15.791Z","evidenceHash":"94eabe6034df60874b10d32e12e9815032877c4114bd153fbf4ccef78a9d39a1"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T06:14:15.791Z","evidenceHash":"94eabe6034df60874b10d32e12e9815032877c4114bd153fbf4ccef78a9d39a1"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ZWS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ZWS.png","website":"https://www.zurnelkay.com","ceo":"Todd A. Adams","full_time_employees":"2600","description":"Zurn Elkay Water Solutions Corporation (ZEWS) is a leading provider of comprehensive water system solutions. The company is involved in the entire lifecycle, from design and procurement to manufacturing and marketing, with a focus on optimizing water quality, safety, flow management, and conservation within and around non-residential structures. ZEWS markets a diverse portfolio of products under several well-known brands. Under its flagship Zurn brand, offerings include finish plumbing fixtures, drainage and interception systems, water control and backflow prevention devices, fire protection equipment, PEX pipe fittings and accessories, and essential repair parts. The World Dryer brand specializes in hand and hair dryers, alongside baby changing stations. Furthermore, its Just Manufacturing brand provides a wide array of robust stainless steel products. This encompasses specialized sinks for academic institutions and classrooms, ADA-compliant commercial sinks and plumbing fixtures for assisted living facilities, various faucets, bubblers, drains, and accessories. These stainless steel solutions also cater to sectors like food service, government, healthcare, hospitality, institutional, and even select residential applications. These solutions are deployed across a broad spectrum of markets, including higher education, healthcare, retail, restaurant, hospitality, general education, government, and fire protection. Incorporated in 2006, the company, formerly known as Zurn Water Solutions Corporation, is headquartered in Milwaukee, Wisconsin.","description_en":"Zurn Elkay Water Solutions Corporation (ZEWS) is a leading provider of comprehensive water system solutions. The company is involved in the entire lifecycle, from design and procurement to manufacturing and marketing, with a focus on optimizing water quality, safety, flow management, and conservation within and around non-residential structures. ZEWS markets a diverse portfolio of products under several well-known brands. Under its flagship Zurn brand, offerings include finish plumbing fixtures, drainage and interception systems, water control and backflow prevention devices, fire protection equipment, PEX pipe fittings and accessories, and essential repair parts. The World Dryer brand specializes in hand and hair dryers, alongside baby changing stations. Furthermore, its Just Manufacturing brand provides a wide array of robust stainless steel products. This encompasses specialized sinks for academic institutions and classrooms, ADA-compliant commercial sinks and plumbing fixtures for assisted living facilities, various faucets, bubblers, drains, and accessories. These stainless steel solutions also cater to sectors like food service, government, healthcare, hospitality, institutional, and even select residential applications. These solutions are deployed across a broad spectrum of markets, including higher education, healthcare, retail, restaurant, hospitality, general education, government, and fire protection. Incorporated in 2006, the company, formerly 